return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-14T12:27:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-14T12:27:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A fast, privacy-respecting live chat for your website. Answers visitors with AI when you are busy, hands them to you when they need a person, and emails you anything you miss. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until somebody opens it.'=>'ÌbÌrọ̀rò àti ìfẹ́ àṣirí fún ojú ojú wẹ́bù rẹ. Ó ń dáhùn sí àwọn àpèjò pèlú AI nígbà tí o bá ní ìṣẹ́ lára, ó ń fi wọ́n lé ọ lọ́wọ́ nígbà tí wọ́n ní ìlò ènìyàn, ó sí ń fi ìmélù raǹṣẹ́ sí ọ nítorí ohunkohun tí o bá sì. Ó kéré ju 10 KB lórí ojú èwé náà kò sí ìbéeré kankan tí ó wà tiiti di ìgbà tí ènìyàn bá ṣí i.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Settings'=>'Eto','That does not look like a Zinn® Chat key. Copy it from the Live chat page of your Zinn Digital® dashboard — it starts with zc_.'=>'Ko dabi bẹẹ pe o jẹ bọtọ Zinn® Chat. Da a kọ lati ojú ewé ìtumọ̀ Live chat ti daṣibọọdu Zinn Digital® rẹ — o bẹrẹ pẹlu zc_.','Add your chat key before switching the chat on — without it there is nothing for the widget to connect to.'=>'Fi kọ́kọ́ kún bọtìni ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ rẹ ká tó tan ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ náà — láìsí i, kò sí ohun tí widget náà lè sopọ̀ mọ́.','Live chat for this site. Visitors get an answer straight away, you get anything you miss by email, and the whole thing is under 10 KB on the page.'=>'Lífa ifọrọwọrọ fun ojula yii. Awọn alejo gba idahun lẹsẹkẹsẹ, o gba ohunkohun ti o padanu nipasẹ imeeli, ati pe gbogbo nkan naa wa labẹ 10 KB lori oju-iwe naa.','The chat is live on this site.'=>'Ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ náà wà ní ìkànnì yìí.','The chat is switched off. Nothing is loaded on your site.'=>'A ti pa iwiregbe naa. Ko si ohun ti o kojọ lori aaye rẹ.','Chat key'=>'Bọtìnì ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀','Copy this from the Live chat page of your %s.'=>'Da é kuro ninu ojúewé ìjíròròàyè ti %s rẹ.','Zinn Digital® dashboard'=>'Dasibọọdu Zinn Digital®','Show the chat'=>'Fi iwiregbe naa han','Show the chat window to visitors of this site'=>'Fi ferese iwiregbe han fun awọn alejo ti aaye yii','Until you tick this, the plugin adds nothing at all to your pages — no script, no cookie, no requests.'=>'Titi di igba ti o ba fi ami si eyi, plugin naa ko fi ohunkohun kun awọn oju-iwe rẹ rara — ko si iwe afọwọkọ, ko si kuki, ko si awọn ibeere.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́ni àti àwọn iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́n olùṣlò','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọnisọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ìgbékalẹ̀ wẹ́bù Zinn® fún WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfipamọ́ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣípò padà ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìṣàkóso tó rọrùn fún àwọn tó ní ju ojú opó kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ati ta awọn aaye ti a ti mulẹ, awọn ìpín (domains) ati awọn aye fifi si linki, pẹlu owo ti o wa ni ipamọ lailewu titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba awọn eniyan ti eyi jẹ iṣẹ wọn siṣẹ','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà àwọn alágbàṣe agbaye wa: wo ju 10,000 awọn iṣẹ ti a ti ṣetan lọ lati ọdọ awọn onkọwe, awọn apẹẹrẹ, awọn olùgbóògì ati awọn amoye SEO, tabi fi iṣẹ kan sori ẹrọ ki o jẹ ki wọn bid.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo awọn akọsilẹ itusilẹ Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìgbékẹ̀lẹ̀ ìṣọ̀tún tí a ṣe sílẹ̀ kùnà àti pé a kò fi í sori ẹrọ náà.','Everything here keeps working for nothing, for ever. Pro is for when one person answering, and a month of history, stops being enough.'=>'Ohun gbogbo nibi yoo tẹsiwaju lati ṣiṣẹ laisi isanwo, lailai. Pro jẹ fun nigbati eniyan kan ba n dahun, ati oṣu kan ti itan, ti dẹkun lati to.','As many colleagues answering at once as you like — the free plugin allows one.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀ àwọn alájọṣepọ̀ tó o fẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà ló lè dáhùn — plọ́ọ̀gì ọ̀fẹ́ náà yọ̀ǹda fún ẹnì kan.','Every conversation kept for ever, instead of thirty days.'=>'Gbogbo iwiregbe ni a n tọju laelae, dipo ọjọ ọgbọn.','Your own name on the chat window, with ours removed.'=>'Oruko ti ara re lori ferese iwiregbe, ti ti wa si kuro.','Saved replies, transfer a conversation to a colleague, and business hours.'=>'Àwọn ìdáhùn tí a ti fi pamọ́, gbigbe ìjíròrò kan kalẹ̀ sí ẹlẹgbẹ́ rẹ, àti àkókò iṣẹ́.','5,000 AI answers a month rather than 100.'=>'Àwọn ìdáhùn AI 5,000 lọ́dún ní dípò 100.','Choose exactly which pages the chat appears on — or hide it from the checkout.'=>'Yanà àwọn ojú ewé gan-an tí ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ yóò ti hàn — tàbí kí o fi pamọ́ kúrò ní ojú ẹ̀rọ ìṣẹ̀san-ówó náà.','One licence covers three of your sites; ten-site licences are available.'=>'Lẹ́ẹ̀kan ṣoṣo ni ìwé àṣẹ kan bo ojula mẹta rẹ; àwọn ìwé àṣẹ ojula mẹ́wàá wà fún lílò.','See what Pro costs'=>'Wo iye ti Pro jẹ','Already host a site with Zinn Digital®? Pro is included free — your key is on the %s.'=>'Ṣe o ti ni aaye kan tẹlẹ pẹlu Zinn Digital®? A wa Pro fẹ́ fẹ́fẹ́ — bọtínì rẹ wa lori %s.','Licences page of your dashboard'=>'Ojú-ewé àwọn ìwé àṣẹ ti ìṣàkóso rẹ','Your licence is active.'=>'Ìwé-àṣẹ rẹ wà ní ipò lílò.','Your licence has run out but everything still works for a short while. Renew it to keep receiving updates.'=>'Àwé rẹ ti parí ṣùgbọ́n ohun gbogbo ṣì ń ṣiṣẹ́ fún ìgbà díẹ̀. Tun un ṣe láti máa gba àwọn ìsọfúnni tuntun lọ́wọ́.','We do not recognise that licence key. Copy it again from the Licences page of your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'A ko mọ bọtọ̀ iwe-ašẹ yẹn. Ṣe ėda rẹ̀ lẹ́kọ̀ọ́ láti ojúewé Iwe-ašẹ ti dašibọ̀du Zinn Digital® rẹ̀.','That key is for a different Zinn® plugin. The one you want is on the Licences page of your dashboard, next to Zinn® Chat Pro.'=>'Bọtìni yẹn jẹ́ fún àfikún Zinn® mìíràn. Èyí tí o fẹ́ wà lórí ojú ewé Àwọn Ìwé-àṣẹ ti dasibọọdù rẹ, lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ Zinn® Chat Pro.','Your licence has expired. Renew it from your Zinn Digital® dashboard to switch the Pro features back on.'=>'Aṣẹ rẹ ti pari. Ṣe isọdọtun rẹ lati daṣibọọdu Zinn Digital® rẹ lati tan awọn ẹya Pro naa sẹhin.','This licence has been cancelled.'=>'A ti fagile iwe-ašẹ yii.','This licence is on hold. Please get in touch and we will sort it out.'=>'Ìwé àṣẹ yìí wà ní ìdúró. Jọ̀wọ́ kàn sí wa, a ó sì tún un ṣe.','There is a billing problem on your Zinn Digital® account. Once it is settled the licence works again straight away.'=>'Ìṣòro ìsanwó wà lórí àkántì Zinn Digital® rẹ. Ní kete tí a ti yanju rẹ̀, ìwé àṣẹ náà yóò tún ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan náà lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','This licence came free with your Zinn® hosting, and that hosting has ended. Buy a licence, or start hosting with us again, to switch Pro back on.'=>'Iwe-ašẹ yii wa ni ọfẹ pẹlu igbaleji Zinn® rẹ, ati pe igbaleji yẹn ti pari. Ra iwe-ašẹ kan, tabi bẹrẹ igbaleji pẹlu wa lẹẹkan si, lati tan Pro sẹhin.','Every site on this licence is in use. Release one below, or upgrade to cover more sites.'=>'Gbogbo ojula to wa lori iwe-aşẹ yi ni a nlo. Tu ọkan silẹ ni isalẹ, tabi ṣe igbesoke lati ni agbara fun awọn ojula miiran.','We could not confirm your licence just now. Nothing has changed on your site; we will try again shortly.'=>'Àwa kò lè fẹsẹ̀ olùwé àṣẹ yín múlẹ̀ lókè yìí. Kò sí ohun tí ó yiipadà lórí aayè aránṣẹ yín; àwa yóò tún gbiyanjú láìpéé.','You do not have permission to manage licences on this site.'=>'O ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso awọn iwe-aṣẹ lori aaye yii.','Your Pro licence'=>'Iwe-ašẹ Pro rẹ','Licence key'=>'Bọtìnì ìwé àṣẹ','Copy it from the Licences page of your %s.'=>'Ṣe daakọ rẹ lati oju-ewe Awọn Iwe-ašẹ ti %s rẹ.','Renews on %s.'=>'A tun se lori %s.','Using %1$d of %2$d sites.'=>'Lilo %1$d ninu %2$d awọn aaye.','In use on: %s. Release one from your dashboard, then try again.'=>'Ninu lilo lori: %s. Tu ọkan silẹ lati dasibodu rẹ, lẹhinna tun gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','Save licence'=>'Fi ìwé-àṣẹ pamọ́','Remove it from this site'=>'Yọ ọ kuro ninu aaye yii','Where the chat appears'=>'Ibi ti iwiregbe ti han','Show it'=>'Fi hàn án','Everywhere on this site'=>'Gbogbo ibi lori aaye yii','Only on the pages I choose below'=>'Lori awọn oju-iwe ti mo yan ni isalẹ nikan','Everywhere except the pages I choose below'=>'Gbogbo ibi yato sí àwọn ojú-ewé tí mo yan ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí','Page or post IDs'=>'Àwọn ID ojúewé tàbíifiwerránṣẹ́','Separate them with commas. The ID is in the address bar while you edit a page.'=>'Fi àìmọ̀ tàbí àmì ìṣàlẹ̀ (comma) ya wọ́n sọtọ̀. ID náà wà nínú pátákápàá àdírẹ̀sì nígbà tí o bá ń ṣàtúnṣe ojú-ewé kan.','Whole content types'=>'Gbogbo awọn iru akoonu','Signed-in visitors'=>'Awọn alejo tiwọle','Hide the chat from people who are signed in to this site'=>'Fi ìjíròrò náà pamọ́ kúrò lójú àwọn èèyàn tí wọ́n ti wọ inú ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí','Save where it appears'=>'Fipamọ ibi ti o han']];